ControlledBurn renders an interactive topology graph of discovered devices and
firewall rules, so you can visually audit which rule governs traffic to and
from each device on your network.

Devices are discovered from dnsmasq leases and DNS host overrides; firewall
rules and their pass/block relationships to each device are discovered
automatically from the active ruleset. Nodes are draggable and the layout can
be filtered down to a chosen set of entities.
